{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_tachak_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_tachak_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "一如既往",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_tachak_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d45d580e8684749bd2abbf47dbf3d794ba5964f75c2f0e892342e584b8adfb68",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“你收到這封信的時候，那邊多半已經入冬了。”\n“烏薩斯的冬天想必更加惡劣。”\n“如果可以的話，我希望你能早一點回來。”\n“我希望你沒有被捲入那邊的亂局裡。”\n“最後還有一句友善的提醒。”\n“我知道你做事的風格，但是別摻和太深。”\n“祝你好運，Lord。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "“別摻和太深”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "現在說這些，也沒什麼意義了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "亞歷山大看著眼前的設備與工具，發出了一聲長嘆，默默地收起了那封信件。\n伴隨著他的嘆息，凝聚的水汽在空氣中形成了一片薄霧。\n在他眼前擺放著一台造型古怪的設備，厚實的金屬軌道上充滿粗糙打磨的痕跡，未經拋光的板材略顯浮鏽。\n在古怪設備旁邊，亞歷山大小心謹慎地操作著用木頭搭建的吊裝工具，進行最後的作業。\n吊運台的麻繩上掛著一台源石發動機，也是眼前這台古怪設備的最後一塊拼圖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "搞定！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "聯軸器沒什麼問題，我的扳手呢……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "水平尺，我把水平尺丟哪了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "魁梧的士兵從一旁的木箱裡拿出了一把用樺木與小玻璃瓶自製的水平尺，盡可能地調整發動機與設備之間連接件的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "我看看……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "供能裝置正常，電壓……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "這哪裡能弄到電壓表啊，勉強用吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "五十年代的時候他們都是怎麼造這些東西的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "這個力矩……希望材料夠結實。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在數分鐘的擺弄後，倉庫裡傳出了陣陣機械的轟鳴聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "哈！哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "成功了！哈哈哈哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "動起來了！哈哈哈哈！動起來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "亞歷山大先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "阿爾蘇先生，你來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "這麼早你就在工作了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "哎喲？這機器終於動起來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "值得慶祝啊！熬了兩個月，也算是沒有白費功夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "可惜酒已經喝完了，不知道商隊什麼時候才來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "這可不好說，一到冬天那些商隊的人就不願意走太遠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "有了這台機器，就算是商隊的人不來，我也可以自己加工一些簡單的零件。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "比如，上次壞掉的那台手搖泵就可以修好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "之後可以教教村裡其他人怎麼操作這台機器，會方便很多的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "這種機器叫什麼來著……車床？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "以前聽我兒子聊過這些……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "說起來，我來這邊這麼久，還沒見過你兒子呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "他工作的地方雖然不遠，但出了村子要翻一座山才能到，一到冬天山路就不好走，所以我很少讓他回來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "山的東邊？那邊確實有個礦區，好像是附近移動城市的附屬地塊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "亞歷山大先生似乎對這附近的情況很熟悉啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "之前去和流民聚落交換物資的時候，我多打聽了一點周圍的狀況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "過幾天可能還得去一次，希望在此之前不要下大雪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "這段時間你還是別去找那些荒地人了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "稅官的隊伍就要來了，要是讓他們知道我們和荒地人做生意，要出大事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "出大事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "其他地方我不知道，但是費季索夫大人不允許我們和荒地人過度接觸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "不准接觸那些流民？為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "以前會有軍隊的人來宣傳，說這些荒地流民很多都是卡西米爾來的間諜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "還有什麼鏽錘之類的暴徒混在裡面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "原來是這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "但是我看那個荒地人聚落的居民大多都是烏薩斯人啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "以前不是這樣的……唉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "前幾年根本沒有這麼多荒地流民，那時候的荒地人大多都是從烏薩斯以外的地方跑來的，很快就會被費季索夫大人的衛兵趕走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "但是現在……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "那個流民聚落裡的烏薩斯人，都是從其他村子逃跑的人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "比如我們村，前些年還有兩百多人呢，這兩年都跑光了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "佃農跑了，人越來越少，也沒人種地，做生意的人也不來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "外加今年要繳的稅更高了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "哦哦，人口流失，這個我熟悉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "那你們的領主呢？那位“費季索夫大人”就完全不管？自己領地裡的佃農全跑了，他吃什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "這……這我也不清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "不過費季索夫大人應該還在忙著處理北邊的流寇吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "怎麼還有流寇？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "哦！是之前村裡人說的那些土匪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "流寇這個稱呼還真少見，這些“流寇”又是什麼人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "這都一個月了，你們的領主還沒解決這個問題？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "普通的土匪也不是烏薩斯軍隊的對手吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "這我也不清楚，但是他們說那些流寇訓練有素，專門打劫貴族的財產，還襲擊了軍隊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "我也不知道一群土匪是哪裡來的膽子……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "訓練有素、反抗貴族的“土匪”，這故事我還真聽過，很耳熟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "不如說太熟悉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "那句老話怎麼說的來著？歷史總是驚人地相似。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "呃，亞歷山大先生以前也經歷過這種事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "沒什麼，我亂講的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "老爺子！老爺子！你怎麼在這裡！他們都在找你呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "喘口氣，喘口氣，有什麼事慢慢說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "哎呀，你快點回家，你兒子……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "我兒子回來了？今天？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "不對啊……他怎麼回來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "你快點過去吧！他出事了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "什麼？？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "婦人",
      "text": "阿爾蘇你可來了，你兒子……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "我兒子怎麼了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "婦人",
      "text": "早上我去整理木柴，結果在村南面看到有人倒在村口，嚇我一跳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "婦人",
      "text": "走近一看才發現是安瓦爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "婦人",
      "text": "幸虧發現得及時啊，要是再拖一陣，可就不好說了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "實在是太感謝了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "婦人",
      "text": "傷口我簡單幫他包紮了一下，他身上沒凍傷，我估計才倒在那沒多久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "婦人",
      "text": "不過……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "婦人",
      "text": "唉，我只能說你可要準備好啊……你兒子，他好像感染了礦石病。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "婦人",
      "text": "他手臂上……你自己看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "這……這……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人顫抖著後退了一步，一臉驚恐地看著自己的兒子。\n恐懼、擔憂、疑慮的神情在短短幾秒內閃過了他的臉龐。\n但是最終只剩下了悲痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "其他人……其他人知道嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "婦人",
      "text": "我還沒說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "求求您，您可……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "婦人",
      "text": "我知道，我知道，你就這一個兒子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "婦人",
      "text": "這幾天我會讓大家別靠近你家，我就說你兒子身上有濕疫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "婦人",
      "text": "但是這可是礦石病，你明白吧？你可得想清楚了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "謝謝您……謝謝……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "看起來情況不是很好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "亞歷山大先生！你怎麼來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "你……你還是先出去……我兒子……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "礦石病，是吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "……亞……亞歷山大先生，這……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "好了，別緊張，我是來幫忙的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "這可……亞歷山大先生，這可是礦石病啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "我接觸過不少礦石病人，我不在乎這個，你放心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "……唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "把他上衣脫掉，把這個藥塗在有結晶的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "這是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "我說了，我之前接觸過不少礦石病人，照我說的做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "這是注射用的藥，你來幫我一下，我去弄點熱水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "還有這個，如果他身上的結晶有血滲出來，把血滴在這個試紙上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "我明白了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幾分鐘後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年輕人",
      "text": "我……我這是在哪……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "安瓦爾！你醒了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "老……老爹？我怎麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "好了，別說了，你回來了就好……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "這裡是……在家裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "不對！我不能待在這，我有礦石病！我……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "我知道……我知道，別說了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "你薩尼嬸好心沒有告訴其他人，也幸虧是她先發現了你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "等你傷好一點，我帶你去林子裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "那邊有個獵人的小屋，廢棄很久了，你就先住在那邊吧，我們回頭再想辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "唉……老爹……我……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "好了，別說了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "你先休息吧，我去打點水，不要亂跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "醒了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "你是……雇傭兵！為什麼村子裡會有雇傭兵？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "別擔心，我是你父親的朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "你的礦石病不嚴重，只是輕症。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "以前沒見過你……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "我也是今年才到這裡來，你叫我亞歷山大就可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "所以到底發生什麼事了，你不是在工廠那邊工作嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "兩週前……工廠的鍋爐炸了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "我和其他幾個工人都感染了礦石病。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "然後工廠的負責人就把我們都趕出去了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "就這樣？沒有人追你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "一開始我們發現有人跟著我們……但是後來也沒管那麼多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "……這麼輕易就放你們跑了，有點不對勁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "算了，你還是先歇著吧，別想那麼多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "你還好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "亞歷山大先生……這……這可怎麼辦啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "答案只有一個，面對現實。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "可……這礦石病……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "你兒子的礦石病是輕症，這種程度的輕症有許多辦法延緩病情的發展。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "你怎麼這麼瞭解這個病……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "這個就說來話長了，不過現在還有另一個問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "在烏薩斯這個地方，就算是輕症，你兒子以後的生活也會非常艱難。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "唉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "那就讓他學會像荒地人那樣活著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "就像是那些捕捉野生裂獸的獵人一樣，他得學會怎麼生活在荒野裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "我可以教他一些東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一週後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "穩住……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "（聚精會神地瞄準）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "穩住……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "（扣下板機）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "啊！沒打中……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "扣板機不要那麼用力，會影響箭矢的軌跡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "唉……可能我不是這塊料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "先別急著說喪氣話，這才一個星期，你這準頭已經不錯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "打活物和打固定靶可不太一樣，再多練練吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "去休息一下，一個小時以後進行體能訓練。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "想要在野外生存，你要學的東西還很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "亞歷山大先生……還真是厲害啊，你以前是一位軍人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "你看起來可比烏薩斯那些普通士兵可靠多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "我現在依然是軍人，只是情況稍微有點複雜……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "說起來，你老爹今天怎麼沒來，這都中午了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "可能是有點什麼事耽擱了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩尼嬸",
      "text": "安瓦爾！安瓦爾！快點收拾東西！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "怎麼了？您慢點，出什麼事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩尼嬸",
      "text": "別問了，感染者糾察隊來村子裡了，他們到你家去了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "什麼？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩尼嬸",
      "text": "你快點收拾東西先走，這邊距離村子太近了，他們肯定會找過來的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "那我爸怎麼辦！我不能丟下他……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩尼嬸",
      "text": "哎呀，你別管那麼多了，要是你被發現了，全村人都要遭殃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩尼嬸",
      "text": "快跑吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "……來了多少人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩尼嬸",
      "text": "來了兩個糾察官和四五個打手，一個個都凶神惡煞的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "都是烏薩斯人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩尼嬸",
      "text": "那兩個糾察官應該是，其他幾個看著不像。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩尼嬸",
      "text": "哎呀，你現在還問這個幹什麼，亞歷山大先生你也避避風頭吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "安瓦爾，帶上你的武器和之前我給你的那套偽裝服，跟我走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "……我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "張嘴啊！人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "他……他沒……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "你*粗口*少給我來這一套，我們看著他跑到村子裡的，把人交出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "大爺，我根本沒見到他！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "我沒騙你，我說的都是真的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "你這個兩條腿的畜生，真當我傻？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "既然你兒子沒留在這裡，那你屋子裡這工服和工鞋是誰的？啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "好啊，你不說沒問題，我們可以找，我們有的是時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "求求你們，你們抓我走！我去為費季索夫老爺做苦工！我什麼都做！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "求求你們，放過我兒子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "你覺得幹苦工這事情就完了？你想得倒是挺好啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "你們幾個，把這附近所有人都帶走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傭兵",
      "text": "明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "你們……你們要幹什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "幹什麼？這個村子因為幫助感染者逃跑，已經犯了滔天大罪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "作為懲罰，費季索夫大人要沒收你們所有人的土地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "我們不知道啊大人！這不關我們的事情啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村婦",
      "text": "大人，沒有這個道理啊，我們根本就不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傭兵",
      "text": "少廢話，都給我抓起來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "這群*粗口*，我就知道……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "這事情果然有蹊蹺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "故意放跑感染者，讓他們回家，好找個理由收了自耕農的地，順帶把他們抓去幹苦力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "感染者可真是個萬能的藉口啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "這故事我也熟悉，一點都不新鮮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "這群*粗口*，我要跟他們拼了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "冷靜點，聽我指揮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "你講，我全聽你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "你看到村東邊那個高地了嗎？你在那邊埋伏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "等收到我的訊號，你就向那五個打手射擊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "別管打中沒打中，剩下的交給我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦爾",
      "text": "明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "村子裡有垃圾，該打掃衛生囉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傭兵",
      "text": "這村子裡能有幾個人啊？我還得挨個去找？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "哪裡那麼多廢話，快去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傭兵",
      "text": "好吧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傭兵",
      "text": "有人向我們射擊！這什麼準頭啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "*粗口*，大膽啊！人在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傭兵",
      "text": "東邊，在那個山坡上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "你們兩個去把人給我揪出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "有敵人，找掩護！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傭兵",
      "text": "敵人？這破地方？怎麼搞的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "雇傭兵呢！你們在幹什麼！還不反擊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "*粗口*！*粗口*！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "其他人呢！快撤！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "沒有其他人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "*粗口*！我的腿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "給我乖乖趴在地上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "當然，我也歡迎你挑戰我的耐心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "阿爾蘇先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "亞、亞歷山大先生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "帶著其他人躲起來，待在屋子裡別出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾蘇",
      "text": "好，好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "你……你們這些敗類……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "剛才的威風哪裡去了？現在可就剩下你一個人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "*粗口*，你敢對糾察隊動手，不要命的混蛋！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "你等著，洛蒙諾上校的部隊就在附近！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "費季索夫大人不會放過你的，你死定了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "貴族，鄉紳，地主。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "我還能期待什麼，你們烏薩斯軍隊就這點本事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傭兵",
      "text": "你……你不是烏薩斯人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "我確實不是烏薩斯人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "比起認識你們嘴裡的地主老爺，我這裡有一位朋友更想見見你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "來認識一下我們狄格帖諾夫同志。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "TACHANKA拍了拍架在地上的機槍，厚重的頭盔下露出了不易察覺的笑容。\n大口徑銃械的爆響聲穿過了寒冬的山林，驚起一片羽獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
